1
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:45,400
Freeze!

2
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,079
Not all justice

3
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:49,719
stands in the sunlight,

4
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,840
nor do all heroes

5
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,719
receive praise and flowers.

6
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:57,120
In a corner of this world,

7
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,640
there is a group of people.

8
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,319
They seem ordinary,

9
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:02,719
yet possess extraordinary skills.

10
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:05,439
Free-spirited in daily life,

11
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,319
yet strictly disciplined on missions.

12
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:10,120
With hidden identities,

13
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,319
they share a common purpose.

14
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,840
Though walking in the shadows,

15
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,240
they safeguard the light.

16
00:02:16,639 --> 00:02:19,479
Silent, yet embodying justice.

17
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:21,719
Diverse and distinct,

18
00:02:21,879 --> 00:02:23,919
they share a single name:

19
00:02:25,479 --> 00:02:26,520
Silent Protectors.

20
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,280
This auction piece comes from China.

21
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,319
It has a long history.

22
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:38,319
Its ancient carving technique is breathtaking,

23
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:40,280
a truly rare treasure.

24
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,599
Wei Tian.

25
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,719
Zhong'an has an old friend in Africa,

26
00:02:42,719 --> 00:02:45,039
a port materials supplier,

27
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:47,039
who is in Antilocaris tonight

28
00:02:47,039 --> 00:02:48,319
taking a flight back home.

29
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:49,879
I just got word

30
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:50,599
that a local band

31
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:52,080
of armed militants

32
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,240
wants to kidnap him,

33
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,919
and they're impersonating you.

34
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,319
Since you Silent Protectors

35
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:58,719
are registered locally and can carry guns,

36
00:02:58,719 --> 00:03:00,520
can you step in for Zhong'an

37
00:03:00,639 --> 00:03:02,039
to protect this friend

38
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:04,319
and get him safely onto the plane?

39
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,360
Captain.

40
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,879
I must win the Tang Dynasty Buddha head.

41
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:08,319
Please donate it to our country anonymously.

42
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,120
Eight million.

43
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,680
Eight million.

44
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,039
Going once.

45
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:13,520
Going twice.

46
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:16,879
Eight million going three times.

47
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,199
Sold!

48
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,639
Wei Tian.

49
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,319
Here's the floor plan of the house.

50
00:03:36,319 --> 00:03:37,120
Take a look.

51
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,719
The area I marked in red

52
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:40,000
is Liu's study.

53
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,400
This room has two doors leading outside.

54
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:07,879
This way, Wei.

55
00:04:07,879 --> 00:04:08,639
Have a seat.

56
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:17,680
Wei,

57
00:04:18,319 --> 00:04:19,639
having you here

58
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:21,519
is truly a huge help.

59
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,480
Come, please.

60
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:25,079
To our meeting,

61
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,519
let's raise a glass.

62
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:33,879
Cheers.

63
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:34,680
Security!

64
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,120
Wait, wait!

65
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,319
Who are you?

66
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,199
Who the hell are you?

67
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:50,800
Xiang sent me to help you.

68
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,879
Were you sent by Xiang Pingsheng?

69
00:05:03,879 --> 00:05:04,519
That's right.

70
00:05:04,879 --> 00:05:06,240
How can they be identical?

71
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:09,199
Xiang likes to

72
00:05:09,199 --> 00:05:10,519
apply a thin layer of wax

73
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,879
before writing on it.

74
00:05:12,199 --> 00:05:13,319
This is a fake.

75
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:22,519
Wei Tian,

76
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:24,079
I was far too careless.

77
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:38,920
Move.

78
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:42,120
Come on.

79
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,720
Failed to stop the target.

80
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,319
Failed to stop the target.

81
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,800
Wei,

82
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,439
for everything this time,

83
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:26,399
I truly have you to thank.

84
00:06:26,399 --> 00:06:27,800
Xiang's business is my business.

85
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,000
We're old comrades-in-arms.

86
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,000
No need to thank me.

87
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:32,680
I really owe you for coming this time.

88
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,920
Meeting the Silent Protectors

89
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,319
was truly my good fortune.

90
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,199
When I get back to Shenzhen,

91
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:41,040
I'll be sure to thank Xiang in person.

92
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:24,480
Commander, sir.

93
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:26,120
Zhong'an Group Overseas Security Officer,

94
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,639
Xiang Lai, reporting for duty.

95
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,319
Come on.

96
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:40,240
Youth always has the upper hand.

97
00:07:45,079 --> 00:07:46,079
Not bad at all.

98
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,279
So,

99
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,839
after completing this mission,

100
00:07:52,839 --> 00:07:54,079
what are your takeaways?

101
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,480
This escort operation

102
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,920
was commissioned by China Dongyuan Group.

103
00:07:58,279 --> 00:07:59,519
Departing from Klang,

104
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:03,279
we transited through Pelepas, Colombo, and Singapore,

105
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:05,000
and finally reached Mombasa.

106
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:06,639
Returning from Mombasa,

107
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,040
the voyage took 36 days.

108
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:10,879
We encountered two pirate attacks

109
00:08:10,879 --> 00:08:12,319
and successfully repelled both.

110
00:08:12,439 --> 00:08:13,439
Zero casualties,

111
00:08:13,439 --> 00:08:14,519
zero cargo loss.

112
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,600
End of report.

113
00:08:19,879 --> 00:08:21,519
Do you know you have a new assignment?

114
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:23,959
Yes, sir.

115
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,839
I'm going to Antilocaris in Africa.

116
00:08:28,879 --> 00:08:30,399
Then why haven't you started prepping?

117
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:36,000
Why the long face?

118
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,120
Commander,

119
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,639
I have a request

120
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,240
I'd like to submit.

121
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:44,919
Go ahead.

122
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,600
I'm a former professional soldier.

123
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:48,879
I'm proficient with

124
00:08:48,879 --> 00:08:50,320
more than 20 types of firearms.

125
00:08:50,799 --> 00:08:52,679
Yet under international security treaties,

126
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:54,440
when on missions in Africa,

127
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:56,480
I'm not permitted to use weapons.

128
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,519
Dad,

129
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,639
please just let me serve on the high seas.

130
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,320
We can use firearms out there.

131
00:09:05,519 --> 00:09:06,399
Without a gun,

132
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:08,320
can't you get anything done?

133
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,519
Does a warrior have to have a gun?

134
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:15,240
"To subdue the enemy without fighting

135
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:17,120
is the supreme art of war."

136
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:17,840
Understood?

137
00:09:18,519 --> 00:09:20,120
You're an Overseas Security Officer.

138
00:09:20,399 --> 00:09:21,679
Your security protocols

139
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:23,679
ensure Chinese citizens and businesses

140
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:25,039
stay safe overseas.

141
00:09:25,679 --> 00:09:27,600
In Antilocaris, West Africa,

142
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,879
more and more

143
00:09:29,879 --> 00:09:32,279
Chinese companies and citizens are investing there.

144
00:09:32,679 --> 00:09:35,320
The branch there urgently needs capable personnel.

145
00:09:35,519 --> 00:09:36,879
That's why I'm sending you.

146
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,080
Do you understand?

147
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,240
Understood.

148
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:41,679
Go get the paperwork done.

149
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,759
Yes, sir.

150
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:57,440
Anda.

151
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:59,840
You've been with the company for two years, right?

152
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,080
Three years.

153
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,120
Three years already.

154
00:10:02,279 --> 00:10:04,000
Our industry is tough.

155
00:10:04,679 --> 00:10:07,120
Especially for a girl.

156
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:09,240
I wouldn't say tough. Men and women are equal.

157
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:12,440
Now, I don't like the sound of that.

158
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,840
How could men and women ever be equal?

159
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,399
You girls...

160
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:18,919
should just live a comfortable life.

161
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:22,600
Take my ex-girlfriend, Tian, for example.

162
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,679
Even though we broke up,

163
00:10:24,679 --> 00:10:26,679
didn't I still put her through

164
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:27,679
business school?

165
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:29,320
Look at her now.

166
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,320
A prominent investor,

167
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,120
an influencer,

168
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,440
richer than me.

169
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:42,919
Don't be nervous.

170
00:10:43,799 --> 00:10:44,600
How about this:

171
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:46,279
Tonight,

172
00:10:46,279 --> 00:10:47,879
join me for dinner with a client.

173
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:48,799
And while we're at it,

174
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,799
I'll pick out some nice clothes for you,

175
00:10:51,279 --> 00:10:52,120
and get you a matching bag.

176
00:10:53,399 --> 00:10:54,279
After all,

177
00:10:54,679 --> 00:10:56,519
you represent our company's image.

178
00:10:56,519 --> 00:10:57,080
That won't be necessary.

179
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,200
I have plans tonight.

180
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,840
Come on, let's just relax together.

181
00:11:00,039 --> 00:11:00,879
Besides,

182
00:11:01,679 --> 00:11:03,919
that watch on your wrist...

183
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:04,879
it looks a bit big.

184
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,120
Let's...

185
00:11:06,519 --> 00:11:08,600
buy one that fits your small wrist...

186
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,679
Wh-What are you doing?

187
00:11:11,399 --> 00:11:12,480
Let me tell you,

188
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,120
that watch on your wrist—

189
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,519
could you ever afford it?

190
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,679
Some guy must've bought it for you!

191
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,639
Stop acting so innocent with me.

192
00:11:20,039 --> 00:11:21,120
I'm warning you!

193
00:11:21,399 --> 00:11:22,879
I don't fight women,

194
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:25,200
but I've trained!

195
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,600
My neck.

196
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:43,600
Come on.

197
00:11:44,799 --> 00:11:45,600
Keep going.

198
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,000
Come on.

199
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,440
One, two.

200
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,120
Good.

201
00:12:08,519 --> 00:12:09,320
Anda,

202
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:12,200
this watch is something your father

203
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,519
never took off when he was alive.

204
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:16,519
Now, Mom is leaving it in your care

205
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,919
to always remind you that

206
00:12:19,679 --> 00:12:21,639
no matter where you go in the future

207
00:12:21,919 --> 00:12:23,080
or what you encounter,

208
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,799
your father will always be by your side,

209
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:29,120
protecting and inspiring you.

210
00:12:31,639 --> 00:12:33,600
I have an important announcement to make.

211
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:36,320
Our overseas market business

212
00:12:36,879 --> 00:12:39,399
is a vital direction for our future growth.

213
00:12:40,039 --> 00:12:40,840
Therefore,

214
00:12:41,279 --> 00:12:43,120
we need someone capable

215
00:12:43,679 --> 00:12:46,399
with outstanding business skills

216
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:49,320
to head overseas and expand our operations.

217
00:12:51,039 --> 00:12:53,000
After careful consideration,

218
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,000
I've decided

219
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:59,480
that our top performer for three consecutive years,

220
00:13:00,039 --> 00:13:00,840
Anda,

221
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,919
will go to Antilocaris

222
00:13:03,639 --> 00:13:05,200
to take charge of our business there.

223
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,440
I hope

224
00:13:09,679 --> 00:13:11,480
you can make your mark

225
00:13:11,799 --> 00:13:13,440
in Africa.

226
00:13:14,799 --> 00:13:16,879
Let's congratulate Anda

227
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:19,120
on her promotion to Plato's

228
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,799
Antilocaris

229
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:23,000
branch as Deputy Director.

230
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,799
Congratulations, Anda!

231
00:13:51,519 --> 00:13:52,320
Have some more.

232
00:13:52,679 --> 00:13:53,519
After you.

233
00:13:55,679 --> 00:13:58,519
The danger you faced this time was my oversight,

234
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,080
and underestimation.

235
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,279
Don't say that.

236
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:04,000
That I'm sitting here safe and sound

237
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,600
is all thanks to you, Xiang.

238
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:08,000
I'm still shaken just thinking about it.

239
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:10,440
I almost lost my life here in Africa.

240
00:14:10,799 --> 00:14:11,600
Indeed.

241
00:14:11,639 --> 00:14:12,919
Wei Tian was also a huge help.

242
00:14:13,799 --> 00:14:14,919
Back in China,

243
00:14:15,519 --> 00:14:17,519
I often heard that public security

244
00:14:17,519 --> 00:14:19,000
in Antilocaris was terrible.

245
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:19,720
That's true.

246
00:14:19,919 --> 00:14:21,440
But I didn't expect it to be this dangerous.

247
00:14:21,519 --> 00:14:22,200
Yeah.

248
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:23,799
They are utterly brazen.

249
00:14:24,639 --> 00:14:25,679
Soon, there will be

250
00:14:25,679 --> 00:14:28,519
more and more Chinese enterprises entering Africa.

251
00:14:29,279 --> 00:14:31,679
Protecting the safety of Chinese firms and citizens...

252
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:33,679
for Zhong'an,

253
00:14:34,279 --> 00:14:35,639
is a daunting task.

254
00:14:36,919 --> 00:14:37,720
Xiang,

255
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,000
a toast to you.

256
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:40,919
Cheers.

257
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,159
Xiang,

258
00:14:48,919 --> 00:14:52,679
I'm well aware of Zhong'an's strength.

259
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:56,399
The top Chinese security firm overseas

260
00:14:56,919 --> 00:14:58,679
is undoubtedly Zhong'an.

261
00:15:00,519 --> 00:15:02,799
But regarding your expansion in Africa,

262
00:15:03,519 --> 00:15:04,679
where do you plan to start?

263
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,240
What do you think, Liu,

264
00:15:09,879 --> 00:15:12,080
about Antilocaris?

265
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,960
Miss, just past this busy street

266
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,279
is the hotel you're heading to.

267
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:35,279
Pull over right here, then.

268
00:16:35,279 --> 00:16:36,279
I'll walk around a bit.

269
00:16:36,279 --> 00:16:37,639
You be careful out there, then.

270
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,919
Here. Thanks.

271
00:16:47,159 --> 00:16:47,960
Thank you!

272
00:17:31,279 --> 00:17:32,240
Welcome.

273
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:34,000
Ma'am, how can I help you?

274
00:17:34,279 --> 00:17:35,880
I expect that starting today,

275
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:37,640
this hotel will see major changes.

276
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:49,200
What a crappy coffee machine.

277
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,160
It's worse than the one at headquarters.

278
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,440
And you are?

279
00:17:53,839 --> 00:17:55,039
Hi, I'm Anda.

280
00:17:55,519 --> 00:17:56,559
So you're Anda.

281
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,279
Hi, I'm Yang Di, the accountant.

282
00:17:58,279 --> 00:17:59,200
But as you can see,

283
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:00,200
there's barely anyone in the office.

284
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,839
I occasionally double as a driver and whatnot.

285
00:18:03,319 --> 00:18:04,720
I'm the Africa commissioner.

286
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:06,680
As of today, officially speaking,

287
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:08,440
I should be your deputy manager.

288
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,720
Um, where is Xiao's office?

289
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,160
Xiao doesn't have an office.

290
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:15,160
This is his desk.

291
00:18:15,799 --> 00:18:17,000
Plato is an external hotel,

292
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:17,920
and we don't have much business.

293
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:19,200
So he just has a desk.

294
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:24,559
Then... what about me? I...

295
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:26,200
There's an empty desk over there.

296
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:27,359
If you think it's alright,

297
00:18:27,359 --> 00:18:28,440
you can put your things there.

298
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,559
It's a bit dirty.

299
00:18:32,559 --> 00:18:33,279
Let me wipe it down for you.

300
00:18:33,279 --> 00:18:34,720
N-No, it's fine. I'll do it myself.

301
00:18:35,279 --> 00:18:37,359
Um, isn't Xiao coming in today?

302
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:40,559
Who knows if Xiao will show up?

303
00:18:41,519 --> 00:18:43,160
Is he resting?

304
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:44,799
Rules are different here.

305
00:18:46,799 --> 00:18:47,960
Alright, get back to your work.

306
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:01,720
Are you sure?

307
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:09,039
Tell me, how didn't I see that move coming?

308
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:14,720
Losing a game a day keeps the stress away.

309
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:18,240
What stress away? I want to win!

310
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,279
What you're experiencing...

311
00:19:21,279 --> 00:19:23,720
is called loss aversion in psychology.

312
00:19:24,559 --> 00:19:26,160
Because you keep losing,

313
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,319
and keep pouring in sunk costs,

314
00:19:29,039 --> 00:19:31,720
your playing will enter

315
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:35,039
an unstoppable mode of increasing entropy.

316
00:19:36,599 --> 00:19:38,160
Cut the jargon. Plain English, please.

317
00:19:39,519 --> 00:19:40,519
It simply means...

318
00:19:40,759 --> 00:19:42,759
you're never going to win.

319
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:50,559
Ten minutes late.

320
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,200
Did you get the new assignment?

321
00:19:54,519 --> 00:19:56,559
I have to make a trip to Plato Hotel tomorrow.

322
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:59,400
You mean that poorly run hotel?

323
00:20:00,079 --> 00:20:01,519
This regular client finished her business here

324
00:20:01,519 --> 00:20:02,839
and is flying home the morning after tomorrow.

325
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:05,400
Don't let your guard down.

326
00:20:05,599 --> 00:20:07,559
Her business here keeps expanding.

327
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:08,759
It's quite possible

328
00:20:09,039 --> 00:20:10,400
that someone has their eyes on her.

329
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,759
She also mentioned in her email

330
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:15,359
that she needs 24-hour close protection

331
00:20:16,319 --> 00:20:17,640
until she boards her flight safely.

332
00:20:18,880 --> 00:20:20,759
How about I take it? You take the day off.

333
00:20:21,519 --> 00:20:22,319
No need.

334
00:20:34,599 --> 00:20:38,119
Smells so good. Want a cup to perk you up?

335
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:41,000
Don't give me that stuff. I don't drink it.

336
00:20:41,839 --> 00:20:44,519
Um, what time is Xiao coming today?

337
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:47,400
Whether he's coming or not is still unknown.

338
00:21:06,519 --> 00:21:07,599
Xiao! Xiao!

339
00:21:08,319 --> 00:21:09,160
This is...

340
00:21:09,319 --> 00:21:10,960
Anda, the market commissioner from headquarters.

341
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:11,960
She arrived yesterday afternoon.

342
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,960
Hello, I'm Anda. I arrived yesterday.

343
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:22,759
Good.

344
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:24,920
Good, good.

345
00:21:27,039 --> 00:21:28,160
So you're Anda.

346
00:21:28,559 --> 00:21:29,359
How are things?

347
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:31,319
Are you getting used to things here?

348
00:21:32,319 --> 00:21:33,160
By the way,

349
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:35,039
in a bit I'll have Yang Di

350
00:21:35,039 --> 00:21:37,519
brief you on the situation here.

351
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:39,319
I already understand.

352
00:21:39,519 --> 00:21:41,759
I did a brief survey before coming.

353
00:21:42,119 --> 00:21:43,079
I have some new ideas.

354
00:21:43,079 --> 00:21:44,160
Take a look, Xiao.

355
00:21:46,519 --> 00:21:47,440
New ideas?

356
00:21:47,839 --> 00:21:48,759
Alright, alright.

357
00:21:49,759 --> 00:21:51,799
Xiao, I think

358
00:21:51,799 --> 00:21:54,599
the working atmosphere in our company isn't very good.

359
00:21:54,599 --> 00:21:55,720
It needs some adjustments.

360
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:57,759
In terms of our environment,

361
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,759
our security is very lax.

362
00:22:00,119 --> 00:22:02,200
The staff are unmotivated,

363
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:04,319
and our business isn't doing well either.

364
00:22:08,519 --> 00:22:09,359
Anda,

365
00:22:10,279 --> 00:22:12,279
you just arrived in Antilocaris,

366
00:22:12,279 --> 00:22:14,440
so you don't really know the local situation yet.

367
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:15,079
As for

368
00:22:15,079 --> 00:22:17,559
why head office sent you here,

369
00:22:17,759 --> 00:22:19,519
I've heard a thing or two.

370
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:20,720
How about this:

371
00:22:20,839 --> 00:22:22,759
don't rush into work just yet.

372
00:22:22,839 --> 00:22:23,640
I'll find some time

373
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:25,720
to take you around

374
00:22:25,920 --> 00:22:27,759
and familiarize yourself with the local situation.

375
00:22:28,519 --> 00:22:30,519
Xiao, if we can

376
00:22:30,519 --> 00:22:32,200
improve the hotel staff's professional skills

377
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:34,000
significantly in the short term,

378
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:37,200
then the hotel's performance will turn around.

379
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,759
In the short term?

380
00:22:43,759 --> 00:22:46,640
If we can implement

381
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:48,359
standardized hotel management as soon as possible,

382
00:22:48,519 --> 00:22:50,000
our working environment

383
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:51,240
will definitely improve.

384
00:22:54,759 --> 00:22:56,000
You've got real drive!

385
00:22:56,079 --> 00:22:57,160
That's great, that's great.

386
00:22:57,519 --> 00:22:59,960
Alright, I'll leave this matter to you.

387
00:23:02,599 --> 00:23:03,400
Wei Tian.

388
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:05,039
Even though Liu requested

389
00:23:05,039 --> 00:23:06,000
close protection this time,

390
00:23:06,039 --> 00:23:07,720
remember, it's strictly business.

391
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:09,039
Keep your distance from the client.

392
00:23:09,039 --> 00:23:11,160
Do you not trust her, or not trust me?

393
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,640
Wei Tian, still posing as a couple?

394
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:13,519
Same as usual.

395
00:23:13,559 --> 00:23:14,359
Okay.

396
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:24,920
Room 316.

397
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:27,920
Here you go.

398
00:23:28,359 --> 00:23:29,160
Thank you.

399
00:23:29,839 --> 00:23:31,559
I'll be relying on you from here.

400
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,440
Let's go.

401
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:34,079
Let's go.

402
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:36,559
I'm glad you could meet with me in person.

403
00:23:36,599 --> 00:23:38,240
We've only ever spoken online.

404
00:23:39,279 --> 00:23:40,559
Not at all, not at all.

405
00:23:41,079 --> 00:23:42,160
The fact that you know of me

406
00:23:42,279 --> 00:23:43,079
shows that

407
00:23:43,119 --> 00:23:45,200
you know the building materials market quite well.

408
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:47,160
This renovation plan is quite unique.

409
00:23:47,519 --> 00:23:49,720
To meet these complex requirements of yours,

410
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:52,160
I'm afraid I'm the only one who can do it.

411
00:23:53,359 --> 00:23:54,000
Indeed.

412
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:55,920
Let me walk you through the details now.

413
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:58,519
First, there's our labor cost,

414
00:23:58,720 --> 00:24:01,519
then there's our working time,

415
00:24:01,519 --> 00:24:02,920
and most importantly, the budget.

416
00:24:15,519 --> 00:24:17,440
Get out! Move in!

417
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:21,920
Gunmen! Everyone hide!

418
00:24:22,759 --> 00:24:23,960
Hurry, hide!

419
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:27,680
Move!

420
00:24:48,440 --> 00:24:49,359
Move, move, move!

421
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:51,000
Get out! Everyone, out!

422
00:24:53,799 --> 00:24:54,799
The client's in danger.

423
00:24:57,160 --> 00:24:58,359
Alert everyone to mobilize.

424
00:24:58,759 --> 00:24:59,519
Move!

425
00:25:00,279 --> 00:25:01,160
Calling Captain.

426
00:25:02,359 --> 00:25:04,160
The package is in danger. Requesting backup!

427
00:25:04,359 --> 00:25:05,160
Copy that.

428
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:07,000
Calling Rossi. Calling Rossi.

429
00:25:07,319 --> 00:25:08,920
Target is under attack.

430
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:09,799
Requesting extraction.

431
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:11,720
Extraction in 15 minutes.

432
00:25:18,519 --> 00:25:19,319
Come out, hurry!

433
00:25:20,839 --> 00:25:21,640
Come out!

434
00:25:23,039 --> 00:25:23,839
Move!

435
00:25:36,039 --> 00:25:37,400
Behave yourselves, all of you.

436
00:25:37,759 --> 00:25:39,400
I'm here looking for someone.

437
00:25:39,880 --> 00:25:41,400
As long as you cooperate,

438
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:43,400
I won't hurt anyone.

439
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:59,160
Listen, you'd best step out yourself.

440
00:25:59,599 --> 00:26:00,759
I know you're here.

441
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,599
Don't force me to act.

442
00:26:03,079 --> 00:26:04,759
The consequences of funding the government to fight us...

443
00:26:04,759 --> 00:26:05,759
you should know very well.

444
00:26:05,799 --> 00:26:07,319
We're not letting you off.

445
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:08,440
And one more thing:

446
00:26:08,720 --> 00:26:10,720
the renovation materials market in this city...

447
00:26:10,720 --> 00:26:12,559
will no longer belong to you.

448
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,079
Even if you sell a single piece of wood,

449
00:26:14,079 --> 00:26:15,119
we'll find out.

450
00:26:15,119 --> 00:26:16,359
They're definitely looking for me.

451
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:18,200
They don't play by any rules.

452
00:26:18,519 --> 00:26:20,119
If they catch me, I'm dead.

453
00:26:20,119 --> 00:26:21,119
Movement upstairs!

454
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:22,319
They're upstairs!

455
00:26:22,880 --> 00:26:23,759
Oh no, oh no.

456
00:26:23,799 --> 00:26:24,759
They're coming up!

457
00:26:25,079 --> 00:26:25,799
What do we do?

458
00:26:25,799 --> 00:26:26,599
What are we going to do?!

459
00:26:29,799 --> 00:26:30,920
Think of something, quickly!

460
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:32,119
What do we do?!

461
00:26:51,279 --> 00:26:52,079
Hurry!

462
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:57,480
Open the door!

463
00:26:58,000 --> 00:26:59,480
Is anybody there? Anyone there?

464
00:26:59,480 --> 00:27:00,599
Open up! Open the door! Is anyone there?

465
00:27:01,359 --> 00:27:02,160
Is anybody there?

466
00:27:02,799 --> 00:27:04,920
Is anyone there? Open up! Open the door!

467
00:27:04,920 --> 00:27:05,759
Anyone there? Open up! Please open the door!

468
00:27:05,759 --> 00:27:07,240
Open up! Open the door!

469
00:27:08,039 --> 00:27:08,839
Open up!

470
00:27:09,519 --> 00:27:11,200
Anyone there? Hurry, open up!

471
00:27:14,759 --> 00:27:15,559
What do I do?

472
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,279
Get in.

473
00:27:21,599 --> 00:27:22,960
Report your location.

474
00:27:26,079 --> 00:27:26,880
Respond.

475
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:34,720
Don't be afraid. Calm down. Take a deep breath.

476
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,200
Take slow, deep breaths.

477
00:27:42,079 --> 00:27:43,400
Are you Chinese?

478
00:27:44,039 --> 00:27:44,839
Who are you?

479
00:27:47,359 --> 00:27:48,400
Answer me!

480
00:27:53,519 --> 00:27:54,920
Captain is in position.

481
00:28:00,599 --> 00:28:01,400
It's okay.

482
00:28:02,839 --> 00:28:04,319
I'll go check the situation outside.

483
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:07,160
Won't that be dangerous?

484
00:28:07,559 --> 00:28:08,359
Don't worry.

485
00:29:19,200 --> 00:29:20,000
Don't kill me!

486
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:20,759
Please don't kill me!

487
00:29:39,839 --> 00:29:41,200
Stop following me. Go back.

488
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:50,359
Wait! Wait!

489
00:29:50,920 --> 00:29:53,240
When can we get out?

490
00:29:55,279 --> 00:29:56,319
Stop talking.

491
00:29:56,839 --> 00:29:57,799
Keep it down,

492
00:29:58,160 --> 00:29:58,920
okay?

493
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:03,720
Don't say a word.

494
00:30:14,599 --> 00:30:15,519
Five more minutes.

495
00:30:15,519 --> 00:30:17,000
If you still don't show up,

496
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:18,519
I'll kill everyone.

497
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:22,240
Don't bother trying to hide or run.

498
00:30:22,799 --> 00:30:24,119
As soon as the five minutes are up,

499
00:30:24,400 --> 00:30:26,000
I'll start killing immediately.

500
00:30:29,640 --> 00:30:31,160
I know you can hear me.

501
00:30:31,519 --> 00:30:33,000
Don't test my patience.

502
00:30:34,119 --> 00:30:35,519
You only have five minutes.

503
00:30:37,720 --> 00:30:39,640
I've assessed the situation in the hotel.

504
00:30:39,720 --> 00:30:40,519
Shalan,

505
00:30:40,640 --> 00:30:41,920
you keep monitoring the surveillance.

506
00:30:42,119 --> 00:30:43,599
Captain, find a sniper position

507
00:30:43,599 --> 00:30:44,559
to provide cover.

508
00:30:44,759 --> 00:30:45,559
Rossi,

509
00:30:45,839 --> 00:30:47,559
sneak in through the first-floor rooms

510
00:30:47,599 --> 00:30:48,920
and help me secure the lobby.

511
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:50,359
We move in five minutes.

512
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:55,119
What if they actually start killing people?

513
00:31:04,359 --> 00:31:05,519
There's only one way.

514
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:10,920
You take the gun and go out.

515
00:31:12,359 --> 00:31:14,519
Pretend you killed all those guys outside.

516
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:17,359
B-But...

517
00:31:17,920 --> 00:31:19,920
We're the few Chinese people here.

518
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,839
If we don't stick together,

519
00:31:23,319 --> 00:31:24,640
there's no hope.

520
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:28,200
Give me your watch.

521
00:31:34,880 --> 00:31:36,440
It's 3:51 now.

522
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:39,160
We have five minutes.

523
00:31:39,559 --> 00:31:40,599
We work together.

524
00:31:47,599 --> 00:31:48,440
Be brave.

525
00:31:48,920 --> 00:31:50,319
I've already locked the safety on the gun.

526
00:31:54,519 --> 00:31:55,960
Calling Captain, calling Captain.

527
00:31:56,279 --> 00:31:57,559
Wei Tian is on the move.

528
00:31:57,920 --> 00:31:59,319
Keep an eye toward the hotel lobby.

529
00:32:00,440 --> 00:32:01,240
Copy that.

530
00:33:03,079 --> 00:33:03,920
Who are you?

531
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:06,119
Why did you take my people hostage?

532
00:33:06,319 --> 00:33:07,359
Do you have a death wish?

533
00:33:31,359 --> 00:33:33,079
Move, move, move!

534
00:33:56,119 --> 00:33:56,920
Quick, get inside!

535
00:33:56,920 --> 00:33:57,920
Keep up! Move!

536
00:33:57,920 --> 00:33:59,160
Protect the hostages.

537
00:34:03,559 --> 00:34:05,440
Calm down. Don't be afraid.

538
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:07,000
The situation has been resolved.

539
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:09,159
The thugs weren't after you.

540
00:34:09,519 --> 00:34:10,559
I'm sending people right now

541
00:34:11,440 --> 00:34:13,000
to take you somewhere safer.

542
00:34:15,599 --> 00:34:17,920
Surviving a disaster means good fortune is sure to follow.

543
00:34:18,480 --> 00:34:19,280
If you ask me,

544
00:34:19,599 --> 00:34:21,719
we should finalize the contract details ASAP

545
00:34:21,719 --> 00:34:23,599
to avoid further complications.

546
00:34:24,159 --> 00:34:26,159
How can you still endlessly talk about the contract?

547
00:34:26,280 --> 00:34:27,599
Have you forgotten what just happened?

548
00:34:27,719 --> 00:34:29,360
Everyone in the hotel was held at gunpoint,

549
00:34:29,360 --> 00:34:30,360
all because of you!

550
00:34:30,800 --> 00:34:32,480
Silly child, you don't understand.

551
00:34:32,480 --> 00:34:33,760
You must be new here.

552
00:34:34,079 --> 00:34:35,840
You'll know after some time.

553
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:38,400
This place has too many uncertainties.

554
00:34:38,559 --> 00:34:40,000
None of what you're saying matters.

555
00:34:40,159 --> 00:34:41,639
If it weren't for that Chinese man just now...

556
00:34:54,199 --> 00:34:55,400
With something like this happening at the hotel,

557
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:56,639
and the situation being so dangerous,

558
00:34:56,840 --> 00:34:57,559
where were you?

559
00:34:57,559 --> 00:34:59,599
Let me ask you, where were you then?

560
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:02,039
You forgot the most important point.

561
00:35:02,039 --> 00:35:02,920
Do you know?

562
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:05,719
Our ceiling got shot to pieces.

563
00:35:07,039 --> 00:35:08,440
Hurry up and send headquarters

564
00:35:08,440 --> 00:35:09,960
a detailed report

565
00:35:10,079 --> 00:35:11,599
to apply for repair funds.

566
00:35:11,719 --> 00:35:14,039
Without money, we can't fix the ceiling.

567
00:35:14,039 --> 00:35:15,079
If we can't fix the ceiling,

568
00:35:15,079 --> 00:35:16,079
how can we operate normally?

569
00:35:16,079 --> 00:35:17,280
Without normal operations,

570
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:18,719
how do we improve our performance?

571
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:20,719
Crucially, you must explain

572
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:23,400
that we are facing a very

573
00:35:23,639 --> 00:35:25,000
dangerous situation here.

574
00:35:25,320 --> 00:35:27,159
We are having a very, very hard time here.

575
00:35:27,159 --> 00:35:28,960
Make sure you write this clearly, got it?

576
00:35:29,360 --> 00:35:31,159
The main thing is getting the funding.

577
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:33,840
I barely made it out alive!

578
00:35:34,119 --> 00:35:35,400
I'm not taking this project anymore.

579
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:37,119
If you force me, I'll resign.

580
00:35:37,320 --> 00:35:38,159
Resign?

581
00:35:39,719 --> 00:35:40,840
Before you came here,

582
00:35:41,239 --> 00:35:42,920
the company had you sign

583
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:44,199
a thick stack of documents, right?

584
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:45,280
Yeah.

585
00:35:45,440 --> 00:35:46,320
In those documents,

586
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:48,800
the company bought you premium life insurance,

587
00:35:48,960 --> 00:35:50,280
a non-compete clause,

588
00:35:50,280 --> 00:35:51,400
anyway, a bunch of rules and restrictions.

589
00:35:51,719 --> 00:35:53,639
I assume you didn't even have time to read them.

590
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:54,800
So what?

591
00:35:55,159 --> 00:35:57,400
If you quit or leave without permission,

592
00:35:57,400 --> 00:35:58,440
you'll have to compensate

593
00:35:58,440 --> 00:36:00,800
for the massive losses you cause the company.

594
00:36:01,840 --> 00:36:02,639
And what's more,

595
00:36:02,920 --> 00:36:04,239
this is the non-compete clause.

596
00:36:04,320 --> 00:36:05,199
That means

597
00:36:05,599 --> 00:36:07,280
if you quit right now,

598
00:36:07,280 --> 00:36:08,639
then within three years,

599
00:36:08,679 --> 00:36:09,599
you are not allowed to engage

600
00:36:09,599 --> 00:36:11,800
in any job related to this industry.

601
00:36:12,280 --> 00:36:13,079
Understood?

602
00:36:14,159 --> 00:36:16,119
Why didn't I know about all these conditions?

603
00:36:17,239 --> 00:36:19,159
It's normal that you didn't know.

604
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:20,480
That doesn't matter.

605
00:36:20,480 --> 00:36:22,920
The key is to get this project done well.

606
00:36:22,920 --> 00:36:23,920
Then you'll have results,

607
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:25,639
and performance means bonuses!

608
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:26,840
Maybe upon returning to China,

609
00:36:26,840 --> 00:36:28,960
you could even get a promotion.

610
00:36:31,079 --> 00:36:32,920
Then who will protect my personal safety?

611
00:36:34,079 --> 00:36:35,400
Take this back and study it carefully.

612
00:36:36,159 --> 00:36:38,239
What security strategy manual?

613
00:36:38,320 --> 00:36:39,159
It's so thin!

614
00:36:39,199 --> 00:36:40,440
Can it stop bullets for me?

615
00:36:40,519 --> 00:36:41,599
Can it help me escape?

616
00:36:42,159 --> 00:36:44,119
What I need is someone to protect me,

617
00:36:44,119 --> 00:36:45,079
to guarantee my safety.

618
00:36:45,079 --> 00:36:46,000
If you won't cooperate,

619
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:46,920
I'm not going anywhere.

620
00:36:48,719 --> 00:36:50,000
You... you do have a place to go.

621
00:36:50,559 --> 00:36:51,320
Here.

622
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:53,440
It's a security company.

623
00:36:53,679 --> 00:36:55,960
You can go over and talk to them,

624
00:36:56,000 --> 00:36:57,599
and see if they can help you with anything.

625
00:36:59,119 --> 00:36:59,920
Go on.

626
00:37:11,239 --> 00:37:12,159
Here's the thing.

627
00:37:12,199 --> 00:37:14,000
Our company previously

628
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:15,559
signed an agreement with you,

629
00:37:15,719 --> 00:37:18,239
but you only provided a proposal.

630
00:37:18,639 --> 00:37:20,320
I was hoping that when our employees

631
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:22,199
go out to work,

632
00:37:23,199 --> 00:37:25,199
you could send more people to protect us.

633
00:37:25,960 --> 00:37:26,719
Understood.

634
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:34,159
Regarding that, here's the price quote.

635
00:37:34,719 --> 00:37:35,639
Take a look.

636
00:37:40,320 --> 00:37:42,800
I'll go back and submit a request before making a decision.

637
00:37:42,960 --> 00:37:43,639
All right.

638
00:37:43,639 --> 00:37:44,320
Thank you.

639
00:37:44,840 --> 00:37:46,400
Take care. Take care.

640
00:37:58,679 --> 00:38:00,559
Why isn't Wei Tian answering my calls?

641
00:38:02,079 --> 00:38:03,119
I have no idea.

642
00:38:03,239 --> 00:38:04,639
Just tell me what's on your mind.

643
00:38:04,719 --> 00:38:06,360
It's nothing major.

644
00:38:06,679 --> 00:38:08,119
I just wanted to ask

645
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:09,960
if Plato Hotel

646
00:38:10,320 --> 00:38:11,840
has contacted you guys

647
00:38:11,840 --> 00:38:14,159
about security services.

648
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:15,320
No, they haven't.

649
00:38:16,039 --> 00:38:18,760
Why? Did your partnership run into a problem?

650
00:38:19,039 --> 00:38:20,119
Here's the situation.

651
00:38:20,400 --> 00:38:21,400
Three months ago,

652
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:23,800
our contract with Plato Hotel

653
00:38:23,800 --> 00:38:24,960
expired.

654
00:38:25,199 --> 00:38:26,039
Yet now,

655
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:28,800
they sent some clueless girl

656
00:38:29,599 --> 00:38:31,239
running over here to ask me for a quote.

657
00:38:32,039 --> 00:38:33,559
Isn't that ridiculous?

658
00:38:33,559 --> 00:38:34,320
Really?

659
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:36,559
They haven't reached out to us either.

660
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:38,639
All right.

661
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:43,119
Take a look.

662
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,079
Mom.

663
00:38:50,079 --> 00:38:50,800
Anda.

664
00:38:51,119 --> 00:38:53,239
Are you getting used to living alone in Africa?

665
00:38:53,920 --> 00:38:55,119
Are you used to the food?

666
00:38:55,519 --> 00:38:57,840
I'm fine. Don't worry about me.

667
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:59,119
Mom, um...

668
00:38:59,119 --> 00:39:00,760
I'll take some photos for you later.

669
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:02,760
Look, I... I'll let you go for now.

670
00:39:03,079 --> 00:39:04,159
I'll contact you later.

671
00:39:55,639 --> 00:39:58,559
Anda, you have to find this person.
